{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_02_end","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_02","title":"热情，或悲怆","storyCode":"LE-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"b5c29e00fd3ac9f987353cefc887f0ab1f2910c789d74421ad63cbd243eb08ad","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"路过的黑键与白垩救下了芙蓉，向车尔尼借的大提琴却因此而受损，两人的合奏依旧未能获得车尔尼的承认，演出的时刻却近在眼前。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"行板竭力为芙蓉抵挡着人潮，但一个人的力量实在太过渺小。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群很快越过行板，将芙蓉团团围住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让我说第二遍，滚！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们到底在干什么？！她是来帮你们的，你们为什么要这么做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板，这事跟你没关系！要是想保护这个魔族佬，就赶紧让她离开夕照区！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白垩？芙蓉在里面......她被人围攻了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让开，让开——让我进去！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又是从哪儿冒出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我想起来了，你是之前流浪到夕照区的那小子吧？乖乖照顾你爷爷去，别多管闲事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉她明明是来帮助大家的，你们为什么要这么对她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你这种人根本不可能懂，我们是在从魔族佬手里保护自己的家园！滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉不是这样的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道芙蓉是来治矿石病的，她全心全意扑在这件事上，你们不也都看在眼里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"治矿石病？谁的矿石病被她治好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，你别来蹚这摊浑水，这里毕竟是维谢海姆，他们不敢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁说我不敢？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你疯了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么事情冲我来，为什么要冲着他施术？这事跟他有什么关系？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我没想冲着人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么好解释的！再不走，你们就要和这把大提琴一样，身上开个洞了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笛声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又从哪冒出来一个碍事的，出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——心跳得好快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*莱塔尼亚粗口*，他怎么冒出来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家，大家别走啊，怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还没听见吗，那个声音......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难道是......难道是那位——难道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您千万开恩，您手下留情，您——我就是多喝了几口，绝对没有对您不敬的意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉酒的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我到底在干什么啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人群......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么快就散了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，你怎么样？没受伤吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，可是琴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这大提琴......面板破得这么严重，还能修吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你出手相助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初次见面——应该不是初次见面了吧。不过，我们一直没能好好打个招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，刚才还挺危险的。虽然夕照区也是维谢海姆的一部分，但一般的治安官可不想来这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他们真的动了手，短时间内未必会有人来帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再次向你表示感谢。我该怎么称呼你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接叫我黑键就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，黑键，他们说的预言，你听说过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全没有。我也是刚刚从人群口中听见这个词的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，这个预言完全没有传到高庭区，是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高庭区？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维谢海姆的贵族应该都住在高庭区，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别把我和他们相提并论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你不是维谢海姆的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确不是维谢海姆本地人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，随意推测一位贵族的身份可不是什么礼貌的举动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是专程来夕照区参加车尔尼先生的音乐会的？你也是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我并未感染矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我听别人说，来这儿参加音乐会的都是感染者——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对话就到此为止吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很着急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然着急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和白垩本来想去车尔尼先生家，请他验收我们今天练琴的成果，结果遇到了这档事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，耽误了你的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先回办事处了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，别伤心了，先去车尔尼家吧。他那么喜欢你，会给你重新挑一把琴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我不是那个意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过也真奇怪，我完全没听过什么“陛下的预言”啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（难道是格特鲁德？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是隐隐约约听过一些......但是很模糊，也没提什么萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，音乐会要紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这群人也真是，要是真喜欢，就应该去女皇之声面前一口一个“那位陛下”“那位陛下”，那才好玩呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不说这些了，我们赶紧去车尔尼家吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，琴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说过了吗，车尔尼会给你挑一把的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，这也不是你的错，就算车尔尼要跟你计较这把琴，也还有我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"琴坏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你们也去打架斗殴了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这样的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来的路上，我和黑键遇到了芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被一帮人围攻了，那些人说她是魔族，会给夕照区带来灾难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无稽之谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去保护芙蓉，结果......大提琴被法术打坏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在街上放法术，这群人脑子到底出了什么毛病！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后你打退了他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是黑键用法术驱散了人群，帮我和芙蓉解了围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他？帮你解围？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把坏琴......唉，像样的大提琴，我也只有这一把啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别道歉了，这不是你的错，反而是我，应该代表夕照区，替那些蠢货给你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之你先把琴放这儿吧，我再找找看，有没有别的琴给你用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就剩这把量产货了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先凑合一下，我来验收你们练习的成果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开始吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生，您......意下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进步不是没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且对你们来说，这是首只练了一天的新曲子，我也不应该要求太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但之前的问题，几乎一个也没解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几乎一个也没解决？怎么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键反应的速度快了不少，可还是会在自己的段落忘乎所以，好像在炫耀什么一样，最后还是要白垩来迁就你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连曲子都还没完全熟悉，有什么好炫耀的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有那些装饰音，倒是都吹出来了，可是连气息都快不稳了，有意义吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩呢，还是比较扎实的，主要的问题也是熟练度，再练练应该会好很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但《晨暮》再怎么说也是二重奏，不可能让一方一直迁就另一方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我真的想撤掉《晨暮》了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不可以这样，让黑键配合您的钢琴伴奏再试一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不会像你一样迁就他，他出丑可不要怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）打起精神来，要一战定胜负了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做好准备了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——怎么样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那股炫耀的劲头完全没变。你觉得长笛是什么？你炫技的工具吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全没打算配合你的节奏，你自己的部分还是比较稳定地完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看出来了，白垩确实是在迁就你，但他只是在迁就你的习惯，不是在迁就你的水平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有待提高的地方还有一大堆，但最低标准，你算是摸到了边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（长出一口气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丑话说在前头，我今天的标准已经拉到最低了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会随时找你们验收成果，如果在演出前还是只有这种水平的话，我一样不让你们上台，明白了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您放心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再有，白垩现在用的这把琴是把量产品，只是应急用的，我还是推荐你们换一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是您原来送我的那把已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，有我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天我们一起去买琴，我给你挑一把最好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻信的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说是那位陛下啊，那位陛下的预言！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻信的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得了，咱们边走边说，你再详细讲讲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
